flowchart TD

    A[User opens app] --> B{What does user want to do?}

    B --> C[Capture receipt]
    B --> D[Voice input expense]
    B --> E[View spending summary]
    B --> F[Manage recurring expenses]

    %% Receipt Flow
    C --> G[Take photo of receipt]
    G --> H[AI reads receipt and detects items, totals, and categories]
    H --> I{Add extra context?}

    I -->|No| J[Expense automatically recorded]

    I -->|Split by X| K[User selects split amount]
    K --> L[AI calculates personal share]
    L --> J

    I -->|Explain by voice| M[User explains what they personally spent]
    M --> N[AI adjusts expense amount and categories]
    N --> J

    J --> O[Show quick summary dialog]
    O --> P{Is anything wrong?}

    P -->|No| Q[User closes app]
    P -->|Yes| R[User edits by voice or manual input]
    R --> S[Expense updated]
    S --> Q

    %% Voice Flow
    D --> T[User speaks naturally about spending]
    T --> U[AI extracts amount, categories, splits, personal share, and notes]
    U --> V[Expense automatically recorded]

    V --> W[Show quick summary dialog]
    W --> X{Is anything wrong?}

    X -->|No| Y[User closes app]
    X -->|Yes| Z[User edits expense by voice or manual input]
    Z --> AA[Expense updated]
    AA --> Y

    %% Summary Flow
    E --> AB[User sees spending dashboard]
    AB --> AC[View categories and pie charts]
    AC --> AD[User checks spending trends]
    AD --> AE[User closes app]

    %% Recurring Expense Flow
    F --> AF{First time setup or editing existing?}

    AF -->|First time setup| AG[User adds rent, subscriptions, utilities, or insurance]
    AF -->|Edit existing| AH[User views recurring expense list]

    AG --> AI[User enters amount and category]
    AI --> AJ{Specify payment date?}

    AJ -->|Yes| AK[User selects payment day]
    AJ -->|No| AL[Save without payment date]

    AK --> AM[Recurring expense saved]
    AL --> AM

    AH --> AN{What does user want to change?}

    AN -->|Edit amount| AO[Update recurring expense]
    AN -->|Edit payment day| AP[Update payment schedule]
    AN -->|Delete recurring expense| AQ[Remove recurring expense]

    AO --> AR[Changes saved]
    AP --> AR
    AQ --> AR

    AM --> AS[User returns to dashboard]
    AR --> AS
    AS --> AT[User closes app]
